  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">THRIVE to End GBV: Together for Transformation, Resilience and Innovation in Sudan</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">AUW focuses on strengthening the capacity of local actors, particularly Community-Based Organisations (CBOs), to advocate for GBV prevention and engage in sustainable and culturally appropriate community-based interventions. The project seeks to create a digital platform that fosters networking, resource sharing, and coalition-building among CBOs, women- and youth-led organisations, and other stakeholders, including men as key actors.</narrative>
  </description>
